{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOAT FPS</strong>\u00a0is a fast paced, old school first-person shooter inspired by the classics from the 90s. You know the ones! That means big, open, hand crafted levels where there is no straight path to the exit. You'll have to explore every corner to find resources that will help you survive. If you've got a keen eye you might even find a secret or two. <br><br>Being a game made entirely by a young overly ambitious Swede, this game is a short, but replayable experience. There's 4 different difficulty levels to choose between, lots of secrets to find and an in-game speedrun timer.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 large, complex and unique levels to explore. All with secrets, items and different paths to take.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/71bc9e440792cc0765eb3b4b8ed94e10.poster.avif?t=1774035506\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/71bc9e440792cc0765eb3b4b8ed94e10.webm?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/71bc9e440792cc0765eb3b4b8ed94e10.mp4?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 difficulties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harder difficulty levels will not only make enemies more dangerous, but will also make ammo pickups give you less ammo. This will force you to play more carefully and thoughtfully. You will have to make the most out of every resource, choose what battles to pick and make sure you find as many pickups as possible. The hardest difficulty &quot;Brutal&quot; is for the real ones ONLY!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/4e1f3a205d37203c324695d049ebc305.poster.avif?t=1774035506\" width=1170 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/4e1f3a205d37203c324695d049ebc305.webm?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 usable power-ups</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health herb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A healing item that becomes more potent depending on how many you use at once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grants temporary invulnerability when used.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grants the ability to fly for a very limited time. Can be used to access places previously inaccessible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sentry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small portable turret gun that fires at enemies. Will explode when shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti-toxic shoes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allows you to walk on hazardous materials.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/23e54fc61a2d33478eec08a9fd439118.poster.avif?t=1774035506\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/23e54fc61a2d33478eec08a9fd439118.webm?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/23e54fc61a2d33478eec08a9fd439118.mp4?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics objects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects that can be picked up and kicked. Use them as shields or jump on them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/c4ad0211480f88ca60c2beda2f8fd6f7.poster.avif?t=1774035506\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/c4ad0211480f88ca60c2beda2f8fd6f7.webm?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/c4ad0211480f88ca60c2beda2f8fd6f7.mp4?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087540?t=1774035506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087540?t=1774035506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/be999e8c050fd32f3a8eda83d9215e08ee5db961/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774035506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/be999e8c050fd32f3a8eda83d9215e08ee5db961/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774035506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoony and unrealistic gore. Lot's of red particles."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOAT FPS</strong>\u00a0is a fast paced, old school first-person shooter inspired by the classics from the 90s. You know the ones! That means big, open, hand crafted levels where there is no straight path to the exit. You'll have to explore every corner to find resources that will help you survive. If you've got a keen eye you might even find a secret or two. <br><br>Being a game made entirely by a young overly ambitious Swede, this game is a short, but replayable experience. There's 4 different difficulty levels to choose between, lots of secrets to find and an in-game speedrun timer.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 large, complex and unique levels to explore. All with secrets, items and different paths to take.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/71bc9e440792cc0765eb3b4b8ed94e10.poster.avif?t=1774035506\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/71bc9e440792cc0765eb3b4b8ed94e10.webm?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087540/extras/71bc9e440792cc0765eb3b4b8ed94e10.mp4?t=1774035506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 difficulties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harder difficulty levels will not only make enemies more dangerous, but will also make ammo pickups give you less ammo. This will force you to play more carefully and thoughtfully. You will have to make the most out of every resource, choose what battles to pick and make sure you find as many pickups as possible. The hardest difficulty &quot;Brutal&quot; is for the real ones ONLY!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap